{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794360655837,"sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_37375a038e274cfc97b772ac","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la && cat README.md 2>/dev/null"},"output":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 node node 4096 Nov 11 01:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Nov 11 01:30 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  118 Jan  1  1970 .dockerignore\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 node node 4096 Nov 11 01:30 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1062 Jan  1  1970 Dockerfile\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  887 Jan  1  1970 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 backend\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 frontend\n# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n","metadata":{"output":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 node node 4096 Nov 11 01:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Nov 11 01:30 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  118 Jan  1  1970 .dockerignore\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 node node 4096 Nov 11 01:30 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1062 Jan  1  1970 Dockerfile\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  887 Jan  1  1970 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 backend\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 frontend\n# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -la && cat README.md 2>/dev/null","time":{"start":1794360655458,"end":1794360655743}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c83abe06001uekaInAwTZVHv4","sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","messageID":"msg_1c83aad3d0017dgX37awLRNAGs"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794360655837,"sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_cf941974a05e4e118e4c8c40","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"find . -type f -not -path './.git/*' -not -path './node_modules/*' | head -50"},"output":"./README.md\n./frontend/package.json\n./frontend/index.html\n./frontend/vite.config.ts\n./frontend/package-lock.json\n./frontend/src/main.tsx\n./frontend/src/App.tsx\n./backend/requirements.txt\n./backend/app.py\n./backend/requirements.lock\n./.dockerignore\n./Dockerfile\n","metadata":{"output":"./README.md\n./frontend/package.json\n./frontend/index.html\n./frontend/vite.config.ts\n./frontend/package-lock.json\n./frontend/src/main.tsx\n./frontend/src/App.tsx\n./backend/requirements.txt\n./backend/app.py\n./backend/requirements.lock\n./.dockerignore\n./Dockerfile\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"find . -type f -not -path './.git/*' -not -path './node_modules/*' | head -50","time":{"start":1794360655508,"end":1794360655752}},"id":"prt_1c83abe700018Jj0xzbmoERn9A","sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","messageID":"msg_1c83aad3d0017dgX37awLRNAGs"}}
