{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794361601604,"sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","part":{"id":"prt_1c8492e290011m2hC2g0Eg6O3Z","messageID":"msg_1c848a565001WmnNTAJ4kjlPcG","sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794361601604,"sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","part":{"id":"prt_1c8492e2c001LutApfctktmfB1","messageID":"msg_1c848a565001WmnNTAJ4kjlPcG","sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a personal timesheet app: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` (auth, entries CRUD, CSV exports) + React/TypeScript/Vite frontend styled with Tailwind, served by the same server on port 8000, SQLite data in `./data`.\n- Must build/run from the workspace-root `Dockerfile`; `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`; persistent data under `./data` survives restart.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace root is `/workspace` (git repo with scaffold: `Dockerfile`, `README.md`, `backend/`, `frontend/`).\n- Docker: multi-stage — node:24-slim builds `frontend/dist`, python:3.13-slim runs `gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app`. Deps pinned via `backend/requirements.lock` (pip constraints) and `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`); update locks if deps change.\n- API contract:\n  - `POST /api/auth/register` `{\"username\",\"password\"}` → 201; `POST /api/auth/login` → 200 `{\"token\": \"...\"}`; auth via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 without valid token.\n  - `GET /api/entries` (params `start_date,end_date,project,page,page_size`) → `{\"items\",\"total\",\"page\",\"page_size\"}`, newest date first. Entry shape: `id, project, description, hours, date, created_at`.\n  - `POST /api/entries` → 201; `PATCH /api/entries/{id}` partial update; `DELETE /api/entries/{id}`.\n  - `GET /api/exports/entries.csv` (filters `start_date,end_date,project`) → `text/csv` UTF-8, header `date,project,description,hours`, oldest first; `GET /api/exports/summary.csv` (filters `start_date,end_date`) → header `project,hours`, sorted by project.\n- Rules: per-user isolation (other user's entries behave as nonexistent → 404); CSV cells must open in spreadsheets as the literal typed text (formula/number/date coercion must be prevented — implemented via `'`-prefix escaping in `csv_text()`).\n- Styling: Tailwind utility classes only; minimal hand-written CSS (Tailwind entry file only).\n- Frontend requirements: register/login forms, signed-in username + sign-out, quick-entry form (project datalist suggestions from earlier entries, date defaults to today, shows API validation messages), entry list with period/project filters, inline editing, delete with confirmation, per-project totals, paging, \"Export CSV\"/\"Export totals\" buttons honoring current filters.\n- Tooling constraints: external-directory writes are denied except `/tmp/opencode/*` (which also appeared blocked in practice) and tool-output paths; tests must be written inside `/workspace`.\n- Environment: Python 3.13.5, Node v24.22.1, npm 11.19.1, pip 25.1.1; system python has no flask; venv created at `/tmp/llmlab-deps/venv` with `pip install -r /workspace/backend/requirements.txt` (flask 3.1.3 installed there). npm registry reachable; `tailwindcss` and `@tailwindcss/vite` v4.3.5 available.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Explored scaffold: `backend/app.py` (health + static frontend serving), `backend/requirements.txt` (flask==3.1.3, gunicorn==26.2.0), `frontend/` minimal Vite React TS app (react 19.3.1, vite 8.3.5, `@vitejs/plugin-react` 6.2.1), Dockerfile/.dockerignore contents reviewed.\n- Wrote full backend `/workspace/backend/app.py`: SQLite schema (`users`, `tokens`, `entries`) at `DATA_DIR`/`timesheet.db` (default `data/`), `ApiError` + JSON error handler (`{\"error\",\"message\"}`), bearer-token auth (`login_required`), register (201, duplicate → 409) / login (401 on bad creds), entries CRUD with validation (project required ≤200 chars, description ≤2000, hours >0 numeric, `YYYY-MM-DD` dates), paging/ordering (date DESC, id DESC), filters, CSV exports (entries oldest-first, summary grouped/sorted by project), `csv_text()` spreadsheet-injection escaping (`'=`, `'+` etc. for formula prefixes/numbers/dates/booleans), `/api/*` catch-all 404 JSON, frontend static serving with index.html fallback, `init_db()` at import.\n- Wrote smoke test at `/workspace/tmp_test_api.py` (uses `DATA_DIR` tempdir, `app.test_client()`; covers auth, validation, paging, filters, PATCH partial, ownership 404s, delete 204/404, CSV headers/ordering/escaping/filters, export isolation, API 404).\n\n### Active\n- Backend test file written but not yet executed.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run `/tmp/llmlab-deps/venv/bin/python /workspace/tmp_test_api.py` and fix any backend failures (verify CSV escaping rows and summary totals expectations).\n2. Delete `/workspace/tmp_test_api.py` when done; build frontend: add Tailwind v4 (`tailwindcss` + `@tailwindcss/vite`, update `frontend/package-lock.json`), implement `frontend/src/App.tsx` (auth screens, quick entry, filtered/paged entry list with inline edit + delete confirm, per-project totals, export buttons), run `npm install`/`npm run build` in `frontend/`, then verify end-to-end (Docker build + smoke test on port 8000).\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API implementation (rewritten; entry point `app:app`).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned deps (flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0 + lock with hashes).\n- `/workspace/tmp_test_api.py`: backend smoke tests (temporary, to be removed).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: placeholder to replace with full UI; `frontend/src/main.tsx`, `frontend/index.html`, `frontend/vite.config.ts` (dev proxy `/api` → localhost:8000), `frontend/package.json`.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `./data` persistence, `frontend/dist` copied next to backend).\n- `/tmp/llmlab-deps/venv`: python venv with Flask installed for local testing.","time":{"start":1794361601580,"end":1794361601583}}}
