{"type":"text","timestamp":1794362115818,"sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","part":{"id":"prt_1c85106cc001IDrz1XI40r1u26","messageID":"msg_1c850c7a8001OGDXpVcMWFbG9B","sessionID":"ses_e37c55911ffecavHBT653S80bE","type":"text","text":"Done. Summary of everything completed:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`)\n- SQLite schema (users/tokens/entries) in `./data/timesheet.db`, bearer-token auth (register 201/login 200/401s)\n- Entries CRUD with validation, per-user isolation (other users' entries → 404), paging + date/project filters\n- CSV exports: `entries.csv` (oldest first) and `summary.csv` (sorted by project) with spreadsheet-injection escaping (`'=…`, `'007`)\n- All 50 smoke tests pass (`backend/test_api.py`)\n\n**Frontend** (React 19 + TS + Tailwind v4, `frontend/src/`)\n- `api.ts` typed client, `AuthPanel` (register/login tabs), `EntryForm` (project datalist, date defaults today, shows API validation errors)\n- `EntryTable` (inline edit, delete confirmation), `Timesheet` (filters, paging, per-project totals + grand total, \"Export CSV\"/\"Export totals\" honoring filters)\n- `npm run build` and `tsc --noEmit` both pass; lockfile updated\n\n**Verification**\n- Full HTTP smoke test against gunicorn on port 8000: health, 401, register/login, create/PATCH/DELETE, filters, both CSVs with correct headers/ordering/escaping, static frontend served at `/`\n- Server restart → data persisted (`./data`)\n- Docker isn't available in this sandbox, so the Docker build itself couldn't run — but it's an unchanged scaffold Dockerfile whose inputs (package-lock, requirements.lock, `frontend/dist`) all build cleanly\n\nWorkspace is clean: smoke-test data/logs removed, `backend/__pycache__` deleted, `.gitignore` added. Nothing committed — say the word if you want a commit.","time":{"start":1794362115788,"end":1794362115792}}}
